      "instance_name": "hate_speech",
      "label": "Hate Speech",
      "description": "Speech that is intended to incite hatred, violence, or discrimination against a group or individual based on protected characteristics such as sexual orientation or identity. The meme is a form of hate speech because it uses a false and grotesque accusation (pedophilia) to target and demean a person, exploiting the fear and stigma surrounding the crime to provoke disgust or shock.",
