      "label": "target individual",
      "description": "The meme targets an individual who is visually depicted as an ordinary, seemingly harmless middle-aged to older man with a white beard, glasses, and a yellow hat, smiling cheerfully. The target is not defined by any specific demographic (e.g., race, gender, religion) but is instead a generic representation of a person who could be perceived as 'normal' or 'everyday'. The meme's hateful intent is directed at this individual as a stand-in for a broader group, specifically those perceived as part of the LGBTQ+ community, by falsely associating him with pedophilia.",
